    "detailed_description": "Clutter IX: Clutter IXtreme is the best Clutter yet, with 1100 puzzles for your entertainment.<br><br>As always, Clutter levels are highly addicting and replayable, with many new Clutter variations mixed in with your old favorites for a Quest you won't forget.<br>In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes included.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532920/extras/93ff7b0b10b3ba00dca2ec84e9ba1df7.avif?t=1726773625\" /></div><br><br>Just wait until you see the new IXtreme (Extreme) variations!<br>You've never seen Clutter this fast &amp; furious.<br><br>Options allow you to play Clutter the way <i>you </i>want.<br>And Favorites are back so you can collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532920/extras/5ec16fd37e08c3cc52860ec582a6aa40.avif?t=1726773625\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New objects and new music<br></li><li>Brand new gameplay modes<br></li><li>Over 100 picture puzzles and box quotes puzzles<br></li><li>Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability</li></ul>",
